Description: Cutefish network monitor and firewall
 Native Cutefish user interface for the OpenSnitch application firewall:
 asks before an application makes a new outgoing connection, records every
 connection and exposes them to Settings. Also installs a default-deny
 inbound nftables firewall that logs what it drops.
